Package: dtaparser
Title: Read Stata Files into Standard R Types
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Description: Reads Stata .dta files through the dta-parser library into
    standard R types: integers, doubles, character vectors, factors,
    dates and date-times, with every missing value NA.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyselect
Suggests:
    haven,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
